2152 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I have more than 8 years of experience in software development\054 web applications\054 frontend development\054 and digital product development\056 Currently\054 I work as a Product Owner  and Frontend Developer\054 combining technical expertise with product and business responsibilities\056\nI have experience working with stakeholders and cross\055functional teams to gather and analyze requirements\054 define product priorities\054 manage roadmaps and backlogs\054 plan sprints\054 and deliver digital products\056 I work closely with development teams to translate business and user needs into clear and practical solutions\056\nWith my technical background in React\056js\054 Vue\056js\054 Nuxt\056js\054 JavaScript\054 TypeScript\054 Node\056js\054 PHP\054 Laravel\054 and MySQL\054 I can communicate effectively with technical teams and understand both business and development perspectives\056 I am also experienced with Agile\057Scrum\054 Jira\054 Git\054 testing\054 debugging\054 and deployment\056\nI am a motivated and adaptable professional who enjoys solving problems\054 improving products\054 and creating solutions that deliver value to both users and businesses\056\n\nPortfolio URL\072 https\072\057\057pila\055portfolio\056vercel\056app\057)
